          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اسباب بازی (asbâb bâzi) — \"a toy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اتاق بچه پر از اسباب بازی است. otâq-e bachche por az asbâb bâzi ast. The child's room is full of toys."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "asbâb 'things, gear' (an Arabic plural) + bâzi 'play'. Plural asbâb bâzihâ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "asbâb bâzi is built in Persian on asbâb, 'things, gear', a loan usually traced to the Arabic plural asbāb, and native bâzi, 'play': play things."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
